                include the recorded comparisons and experiment context.
              </p>
              <p>
                The examples describe historical function-level comparisons
                recorded in the linked commits. Whole-game runtime checks are
                separate milestones. Source and matching records were reviewed
                on 13 October 2026.
              </p>
              <p>
                The TH09 label <code>gpt-dots</code> identifies GPT-6-Astra.
                <code>gpt-web</code> changed with the model used at the time, so
                that label alone does not identify an individual run. Explicit
