        <p class="eyebrow">Inspect → rebuild → change</p>
        <h1>Rebuild the dinosaur’s speed rule.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          To recreate the game’s acceleration, first find the rule that controls
          its speed. <strong>REA returned the running script;</strong>
          we used its rule to build this mini-game with
          <mark class="prose-highlight">adjustable speed.</mark>
        </p>
