            <h2>Read the script REA returned</h2>
            <p>
              We inspected
              <a href="https://wayou.github.io/t-rex-runner/"
                >wayou’s Chromium-derived browser edition</a
              >
              with REA. It returned the loaded <code>index.js</code>, including
              this branch in the game’s update function:
            </p>
