        <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="../">Home</a> / Get started</p>
        <h1>Set up REA.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Set up your computer and coding agent, connect REA, then investigate a
          small app.
        </p>
        <p>
          New to this? Follow the four steps below. Already have an agent? Go
          straight to <a href="#agent">Connect REA</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="article-layout">
        <nav class="contents" aria-label="On this page">
          <p>On this page</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="#computer">1. Prepare your computer</a></li>
            <li><a href="#choose-agent">2. Choose an agent</a></li>
            <li><a href="#agent">3. Connect REA</a></li>
