        <h1>Rebuilding DX-Ball<br />from its executable.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          The goal is a maintainable C version of the 1996 Windows game. REA
          helps the agent inspect the original, one function at a time.
        </p>
        <p class="page-meta">Windows i386 · C · REA</p>
