                      <span translate="no">200 + 10%</span> give 220?</span
                    ><span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                  </p>
                  <div class="agent-reply">
                    <p class="reply-label">
                      Example answer · based on the findings
                    </p>
                    <p>
                      After +, the % button takes
                      <strong>a percentage of the first number.</strong>
                    </p>
                    <div class="agent-percent-rule">
                      <code>10% of 200 = 20</code
                      ><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span
                      ><strong>200 + 20 = 220</strong>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <dl class="agent-evidence-roles">
                  <div>
                    <dt>REA supplies</dt>
                    <dd>
