          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">Example 01 · Chrome’s dinosaur game</p>
            <h2>Why does the dinosaur get faster?</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="lede">
            The game gets faster as you run. To rebuild it with a speed control,
            we first need to find out how the speed changes.
          </p>
          <div class="home-example-grid dino-example-grid">
            <div class="home-case-story">
              <h3>1. Ask about the speed</h3>
              <div class="agent-terminal home-analysis-terminal">
                <div class="terminal-header">
                  <span class="terminal-title"
                    ><span class="terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true"
                      ><i></i><i></i><i></i></span
                    >Example question · Dinosaur game</span
