                    faster? Show the speed rule, then build a small version with
                    an adjustable speed.</span
                  ><span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <h3>2. Find the speed rule</h3>
              <p>
                REA lets the agent read the game’s running code. The speed
                starts at 6 and increases a little each update while it is below
                13.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="home-case-result">
              <h3>3. Play the result</h3>
